WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.090
Process explanations use clear time-order phrases, imperative or present-tense verbs

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.557
and complete steps.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:11.335
Which word shows the first stage in instructions? Answer: First

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:16.360
Write instructions for washing hands, describing why the order matters.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.355
First introduces the opening step.
